SARU 26.08

SARU 26.08 is the first release under the new name.  It succeeds SKYM and
existing SKYM installations can be upgraded directly to SARU.

What is new

  * The application, its helpers, installer and documentation are now named
    SARU - SSH Agent Replacement Utility.

  * RSA keys work more reliably with SSH servers and clients that use current
    RSA signing methods as well as older RSA-based setups.

  * Key-use confirmation, locking and destination restrictions behave more
    consistently.  In particular, locking the agent prevents a pending request
    from using a key afterwards.

  * Communication with supported SSH clients is more robust, including safer
    handling of requests received through Pageant and the Windows SSH agent.

  * Key lists and confirmation windows stay in sync with the current state of
    the agent, making changes to loaded keys easier to follow.

  * Every executable and the Windows installer are now signed with a trusted
    code-signing certificate.  Detached GPG signatures for the MSI and ZIP
    packages continue to be provided alongside the release files.
